{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-design-patterns","title":"合约设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/contract-design-patterns","wordCount":980,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"合约设计模式\">合约设计模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>智能合约设计模式是在区块链开发实践中总结出的可复用解决方案。与传统软件设计模式不同，合约设计模式必须额外考虑三个独特约束：<strong>不可变性</strong>（部署后代码无法修改）、<strong>Gas 经济性</strong>（每个操作都有成本）和<strong>安全性</strong>（代码即法律，漏洞可能导致不可逆的资金损失）。</p>\n<p>成熟的合约项目通常组合使用多种设计模式。OpenZeppelin 库是最广泛采用的合约标准实现，其代码经过严格的审计和社区验证，是学习设计模式的最佳参考。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[合约设计模式] --&gt; B[创建型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[结构型]&#10;    A --&gt; D[行为型]&#10;    A --&gt; E[安全型]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[工厂模式]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[克隆模式]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[代理模式]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[钻石模式]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[状态机]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[预言机]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[重入防护]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[紧急暂停]\">graph TD\n    A[合约设计模式] --&gt; B[创建型]\n    A --&gt; C[结构型]\n    A --&gt; D[行为型]\n    A --&gt; E[安全型]\n    B --&gt; B1[工厂模式]\n    B --&gt; B2[克隆模式]\n    C --&gt; C1[代理模式]\n    C --&gt; C2[钻石模式]\n    D --&gt; D1[状态机]\n    D --&gt; D2[预言机]\n    E --&gt; E1[重入防护]\n    E --&gt; E2[紧急暂停]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式类别</th>\n<th>代表模式</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>Gas 影响</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创建型</td>\n<td>工厂/克隆</td>\n<td>批量创建合约实例</td>\n<td>克隆节省 90% 部署 Gas</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构型</td>\n<td>代理/钻石</td>\n<td>合约可升级性</td>\n<td>delegatecall 额外开销</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为型</td>\n<td>状态机/策略</td>\n<td>复杂业务逻辑组织</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全型</td>\n<td>重入锁/暂停</td>\n<td>防御攻击</td>\n<td>微小额外开销</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济型</td>\n<td>批处理/懒计算</td>\n<td>优化 Gas 消耗</td>\n<td>显著节省</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代理模式与合约升级\">代理模式与合约升级</h2><p>代理模式是解决智能合约不可变性的核心方案。它将合约拆分为两部分：<strong>代理合约</strong>（Proxy）持有状态和地址，<strong>实现合约</strong>（Implementation）包含业务逻辑。代理通过 <code>delegatecall</code> 将调用转发给实现合约，升级时只需替换实现合约的地址。</p>\n<p>三种主流代理模式各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代理模式</th>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>升级机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Transparent Proxy</td>\n<td>固定存储槽</td>\n<td>Admin 调用 upgrade</td>\n<td>大型项目、明确管理员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UUPS</td>\n<td>固定存储槽</td>\n<td>实现合约内置 upgrade</td>\n<td>省 Gas、更灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beacon Proxy</td>\n<td>Beacon 合约指向实现</td>\n<td>一次升级影响所有实例</td>\n<td>大量同类合约实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract UUPSProxy {&#10;    bytes32 private constant IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT =&#10;        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(&quot;eip1967.proxy.implementation&quot;)) - 1);&#10;&#10;    bytes32 private constant ADMIN_SLOT =&#10;        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(&quot;eip1967.proxy.admin&quot;)) - 1);&#10;&#10;    constructor(address implementation, bytes memory data) {&#10;        _setImplementation(implementation);&#10;        _setAdmin(msg.sender);&#10;        if (data.length &gt; 0) {&#10;            (bool success, ) = implementation.delegatecall(data);&#10;            require(success, &quot;Init failed&quot;);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fallback() external payable {&#10;        address impl = _getImplementation();&#10;        assembly {&#10;            calldatacopy(0, 0, calldatasize())&#10;            let result := delegatecall(gas(), impl, 0, calldatasize(), 0, 0)&#10;            returndatacopy(0, 0, returndatasize())&#10;            switch result&#10;            case 0 { revert(0, returndatasize()) }&#10;            default { return(0, returndatasize()) }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    receive() external payable {}&#10;&#10;    function _getImplementation() internal view returns (address impl) {&#10;        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;&#10;        assembly {&#10;            impl := sload(slot)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _setImplementation(address impl) internal {&#10;        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;&#10;        assembly {&#10;            sstore(slot, impl)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _setAdmin(address admin) internal {&#10;        bytes32 slot = ADMIN_SLOT;&#10;        assembly {&#10;            sstore(slot, admin)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;abstract contract UUPSUpgradeable {&#10;    bytes32 private constant IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT =&#10;        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(&quot;eip1967.proxy.implementation&quot;)) - 1);&#10;&#10;    event Upgraded(address indexed implementation);&#10;&#10;    function upgradeTo(address newImplementation) external virtual {&#10;        _authorizeUpgrade(newImplementation);&#10;        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;&#10;        assembly {&#10;            sstore(slot, newImplementation)&#10;        }&#10;        emit Upgraded(newImplementation);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation) internal virtual;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract UUPSProxy {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 private constant IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(\"eip1967.proxy.implementation\")) - 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 private constant ADMIN_SLOT =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(\"eip1967.proxy.admin\")) - 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor(address implementation, bytes memory data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _setImplementation(implementation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _setAdmin(msg.sender);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (data.length > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (bool success, ) = implementation.delegatecall(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            require(success, \"Init failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fallback() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address impl = _getImplementation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            calldatacopy(0, 0, calldatasize())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let result := delegatecall(gas(), impl, 0, calldatasize(), 0, 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            returndatacopy(0, 0, returndatasize())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            switch result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 0 { revert(0, returndatasize()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            default { return(0, returndatasize()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    receive() external payable {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _getImplementation() internal view returns (address impl) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            impl := sload(slot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _setImplementation(address impl) internal {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sstore(slot, impl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _setAdmin(address admin) internal {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32 slot = ADMIN_SLOT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sstore(slot, admin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract contract UUPSUpgradeable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 private constant IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32(uint256(keccak256(\"eip1967.proxy.implementation\")) - 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event Upgraded(address indexed implementation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function upgradeTo(address newImplementation) external virtual {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _authorizeUpgrade(newImplementation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32 slot = IMPLEMENTATION_SLOT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sstore(slot, newImplementation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit Upgraded(newImplementation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation) internal virtual;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户调用] --&gt; B[Proxy 合约]&#10;    B --&gt;|delegatecall| C[Implementation V1]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|升级后| D[Implementation V2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Storage 状态保留]\">graph LR\n    A[用户调用] --&gt; B[Proxy 合约]\n    B --&gt;|delegatecall| C[Implementation V1]\n    B -.-&gt;|升级后| D[Implementation V2]\n    B --&gt; E[Storage 状态保留]</pre><h2 id=\"工厂模式与克隆\">工厂模式与克隆</h2><p>工厂模式用于批量创建具有相同逻辑的合约实例。传统的 <code>new</code> 关键字部署成本高昂，EIP-1167 最小代理（Minimal Proxy，又称 Clone）通过复用已有合约代码将部署成本降低约 90%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;library Clones {&#10;    function clone(address implementation) internal returns (address instance) {&#10;        assembly {&#10;            mstore(0x00, or(&#10;                shr(0xe8, shl(0x60, implementation)),&#10;                0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73000000&#10;            ))&#10;            mstore(0x20, or(shl(0x78, implementation), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3))&#10;            instance := create(0, 0x09, 0x37)&#10;        }&#10;        require(instance != address(0), &quot;Clone failed&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function cloneDeterministic(&#10;        address implementation,&#10;        bytes32 salt&#10;    ) internal returns (address instance) {&#10;        assembly {&#10;            mstore(0x00, or(&#10;                shr(0xe8, shl(0x60, implementation)),&#10;                0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73000000&#10;            ))&#10;            mstore(0x20, or(shl(0x78, implementation), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3))&#10;            instance := create2(0, 0x09, 0x37, salt)&#10;        }&#10;        require(instance != address(0), &quot;Clone failed&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;contract VaultFactory {&#10;    using Clones for address;&#10;&#10;    address public immutable vaultImplementation;&#10;    address[] public allVaults;&#10;&#10;    event VaultCreated(address indexed vault, address indexed owner, uint256 index);&#10;&#10;    constructor(address _implementation) {&#10;        vaultImplementation = _implementation;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function createVault(bytes32 salt) external returns (address vault) {&#10;        vault = vaultImplementation.cloneDeterministic(salt);&#10;&#10;        IVault(vault).initialize(msg.sender);&#10;        allVaults.push(vault);&#10;&#10;        emit VaultCreated(vault, msg.sender, allVaults.length - 1);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function getVaultCount() external view returns (uint256) {&#10;        return allVaults.length;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface IVault {&#10;    function initialize(address owner) external;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library Clones {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function clone(address implementation) internal returns (address instance) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mstore(0x00, or(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                shr(0xe8, shl(0x60, implementation)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mstore(0x20, or(shl(0x78, implementation), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            instance := create(0, 0x09, 0x37)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(instance != address(0), \"Clone failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function cloneDeterministic(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address implementation,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bytes32 salt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) internal returns (address instance) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mstore(0x00, or(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                shr(0xe8, shl(0x60, implementation)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mstore(0x20, or(shl(0x78, implementation), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            instance := create2(0, 0x09, 0x37, salt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(instance != address(0), \"Clone failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultFactory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    using Clones for address;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address public immutable vaultImplementation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address[] public allVaults;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event VaultCreated(address indexed vault, address indexed owner, uint256 index);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor(address _implementation) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vaultImplementation = _implementation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function createVault(bytes32 salt) external returns (address vault) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault = vaultImplementation.cloneDeterministic(salt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IVault(vault).initialize(msg.sender);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        allVaults.push(vault);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit VaultCreated(vault, msg.sender, allVaults.length - 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function getVaultCount() external view returns (uint256) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return allVaults.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface IVault {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function initialize(address owner) external;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 CREATE2 的确定性部署允许在合约部署前就计算出其地址，这对于跨链部署和反事实（Counterfactual）部署模式非常有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与治理模式\">状态机与治理模式</h2><p>状态机模式将合约的生命周期划分为明确的阶段，每个阶段只允许特定的操作。这在众筹、拍卖、投票等场景中广泛使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract GovernorSimple {&#10;    enum ProposalState { Pending, Active, Defeated, Succeeded, Executed }&#10;&#10;    struct Proposal {&#10;        address proposer;&#10;        string description;&#10;        uint256 forVotes;&#10;        uint256 againstVotes;&#10;        uint256 startBlock;&#10;        uint256 endBlock;&#10;        bool executed;&#10;        mapping(address =&gt; bool) hasVoted;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    uint256 public proposalCount;&#10;    mapping(uint256 =&gt; Proposal) public proposals;&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public votingPower;&#10;&#10;    uint256 public constant VOTING_PERIOD = 50400;&#10;    uint256 public constant QUORUM = 1000e18;&#10;&#10;    event ProposalCreated(uint256 indexed id, address proposer, string description);&#10;    event VoteCast(uint256 indexed proposalId, address voter, bool support, uint256 weight);&#10;    event ProposalExecuted(uint256 indexed id);&#10;&#10;    function propose(string calldata description) external returns (uint256) {&#10;        require(votingPower[msg.sender] &gt; 0, &quot;No voting power&quot;);&#10;&#10;        uint256 proposalId = proposalCount++;&#10;        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];&#10;        p.proposer = msg.sender;&#10;        p.description = description;&#10;        p.startBlock = block.number + 1;&#10;        p.endBlock = block.number + VOTING_PERIOD;&#10;&#10;        emit ProposalCreated(proposalId, msg.sender, description);&#10;        return proposalId;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function castVote(uint256 proposalId, bool support) external {&#10;        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];&#10;        require(state(proposalId) == ProposalState.Active, &quot;Not active&quot;);&#10;        require(!p.hasVoted[msg.sender], &quot;Already voted&quot;);&#10;&#10;        uint256 weight = votingPower[msg.sender];&#10;        require(weight &gt; 0, &quot;No voting power&quot;);&#10;&#10;        p.hasVoted[msg.sender] = true;&#10;&#10;        if (support) {&#10;            p.forVotes += weight;&#10;        } else {&#10;            p.againstVotes += weight;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        emit VoteCast(proposalId, msg.sender, support, weight);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function state(uint256 proposalId) public view returns (ProposalState) {&#10;        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];&#10;        if (p.executed) return ProposalState.Executed;&#10;        if (block.number &lt;= p.startBlock) return ProposalState.Pending;&#10;        if (block.number &lt;= p.endBlock) return ProposalState.Active;&#10;        if (p.forVotes &gt; p.againstVotes &amp;&amp; p.forVotes &gt;= QUORUM) {&#10;            return ProposalState.Succeeded;&#10;        }&#10;        return ProposalState.Defeated;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract GovernorSimple {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enum ProposalState { Pending, Active, Defeated, Succeeded, Executed }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct Proposal {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address proposer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string description;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 forVotes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 againstVotes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 startBlock;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 endBlock;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool executed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mapping(address => bool) hasVoted;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public proposalCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(uint256 => Proposal) public proposals;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public votingPower;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public constant VOTING_PERIOD = 50400;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public constant QUORUM = 1000e18;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event ProposalCreated(uint256 indexed id, address proposer, string description);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event VoteCast(uint256 indexed proposalId, address voter, bool support, uint256 weight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event ProposalExecuted(uint256 indexed id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function propose(string calldata description) external returns (uint256) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(votingPower[msg.sender] > 0, \"No voting power\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 proposalId = proposalCount++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.proposer = msg.sender;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.description = description;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.startBlock = block.number + 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.endBlock = block.number + VOTING_PERIOD;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit ProposalCreated(proposalId, msg.sender, description);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return proposalId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function castVote(uint256 proposalId, bool support) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(state(proposalId) == ProposalState.Active, \"Not active\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(!p.hasVoted[msg.sender], \"Already voted\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 weight = votingPower[msg.sender];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(weight > 0, \"No voting power\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.hasVoted[msg.sender] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (support) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            p.forVotes += weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            p.againstVotes += weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit VoteCast(proposalId, msg.sender, support, weight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function state(uint256 proposalId) public view returns (ProposalState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Proposal storage p = proposals[proposalId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (p.executed) return ProposalState.Executed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (block.number &#x3C;= p.startBlock) return ProposalState.Pending;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (block.number &#x3C;= p.endBlock) return ProposalState.Active;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (p.forVotes > p.againstVotes &#x26;&#x26; p.forVotes >= QUORUM) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return ProposalState.Succeeded;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return ProposalState.Defeated;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Pending 等待投票] --&gt;|到达开始区块| B[Active 投票中]&#10;    B --&gt;|到达截止区块 + 通过| C[Succeeded 通过]&#10;    B --&gt;|到达截止区块 + 未通过| D[Defeated 未通过]&#10;    C --&gt;|执行| E[Executed 已执行]\">graph LR\n    A[Pending 等待投票] --&gt;|到达开始区块| B[Active 投票中]\n    B --&gt;|到达截止区块 + 通过| C[Succeeded 通过]\n    B --&gt;|到达截止区块 + 未通过| D[Defeated 未通过]\n    C --&gt;|执行| E[Executed 已执行]</pre><p>治理合约通常还包含 Timelock 机制——提案通过后需要经过一段等待期才能执行，给社区提供退出窗口。Compound 和 OpenZeppelin 的 Governor 框架是当前最成熟的链上治理实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gas-优化模式\">Gas 优化模式</h2><p>Gas 优化是合约设计中不可忽视的工程实践。以下是经过验证的优化模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化技术</th>\n<th>节省幅度</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>紧凑存储布局</td>\n<td>20-50% 存储成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有合约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>calldata 替代 memory</td>\n<td>10-30% 参数成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>external 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unchecked 算术</td>\n<td>5-15% 计算成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>已验证安全的运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理操作</td>\n<td>30-60% 交易成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>批量转账/操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位运算打包</td>\n<td>40-70% 存储成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多布尔值/小整数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract GasOptimized {&#10;    struct PackedData {&#10;        uint128 amount;&#10;        uint64 timestamp;&#10;        uint32 nonce;&#10;        bool active;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; PackedData) public userData;&#10;&#10;    error InsufficientBalance(uint256 available, uint256 required);&#10;    error InvalidRecipient();&#10;&#10;    function efficientTransfer(&#10;        address[] calldata recipients,&#10;        uint256[] calldata amounts&#10;    ) external {&#10;        uint256 len = recipients.length;&#10;        require(len == amounts.length, &quot;Length mismatch&quot;);&#10;&#10;        for (uint256 i; i &lt; len; ) {&#10;            address recipient = recipients[i];&#10;            if (recipient == address(0)) revert InvalidRecipient();&#10;&#10;            unchecked { ++i; }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function packFlags(bool[8] calldata flags) external pure returns (uint8 packed) {&#10;        for (uint256 i; i &lt; 8; ) {&#10;            if (flags[i]) {&#10;                packed |= uint8(1 &lt;&lt; i);&#10;            }&#10;            unchecked { ++i; }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function unpackFlags(uint8 packed) external pure returns (bool[8] memory flags) {&#10;        for (uint256 i; i &lt; 8; ) {&#10;            flags[i] = (packed &amp; uint8(1 &lt;&lt; i)) != 0;&#10;            unchecked { ++i; }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract GasOptimized {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct PackedData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint128 amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint64 timestamp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint32 nonce;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool active;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => PackedData) public userData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error InsufficientBalance(uint256 available, uint256 required);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error InvalidRecipient();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function efficientTransfer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address[] calldata recipients,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256[] calldata amounts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 len = recipients.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(len == amounts.length, \"Length mismatch\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (uint256 i; i &#x3C; len; ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            address recipient = recipients[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (recipient == address(0)) revert InvalidRecipient();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unchecked { ++i; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function packFlags(bool[8] calldata flags) external pure returns (uint8 packed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (uint256 i; i &#x3C; 8; ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (flags[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                packed |= uint8(1 &#x3C;&#x3C; i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unchecked { ++i; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function unpackFlags(uint8 packed) external pure returns (bool[8] memory flags) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (uint256 i; i &#x3C; 8; ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            flags[i] = (packed &#x26; uint8(1 &#x3C;&#x3C; i)) != 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unchecked { ++i; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((合约设计模式))&#10;    代理模式&#10;      Transparent&#10;      UUPS&#10;      Beacon&#10;      delegatecall&#10;    工厂模式&#10;      Clone EIP-1167&#10;      CREATE2&#10;      确定性部署&#10;    治理模式&#10;      状态机&#10;      投票机制&#10;      Timelock&#10;    Gas 优化&#10;      存储布局&#10;      位运算打包&#10;      批处理&#10;      unchecked\">mindmap\n  root((合约设计模式))\n    代理模式\n      Transparent\n      UUPS\n      Beacon\n      delegatecall\n    工厂模式\n      Clone EIP-1167\n      CREATE2\n      确定性部署\n    治理模式\n      状态机\n      投票机制\n      Timelock\n    Gas 优化\n      存储布局\n      位运算打包\n      批处理\n      unchecked</pre><ul>\n<li>代理模式通过 delegatecall 实现合约可升级，UUPS 是当前推荐方案</li>\n<li>EIP-1167 克隆模式将合约部署成本降低约 90%</li>\n<li>状态机模式为复杂业务流程提供清晰的生命周期管理</li>\n<li>Gas 优化需要从存储布局、参数传递、算术运算等多个维度综合考虑</li>\n<li>治理合约通常结合状态机、Timelock 和投票权重机制</li>\n<li>选择设计模式时需要在安全性、Gas 效率和开发复杂度之间权衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合约设计模式","id":"合约设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代理模式与合约升级","id":"代理模式与合约升级"},{"level":2,"text":"工厂模式与克隆","id":"工厂模式与克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与治理模式","id":"状态机与治理模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Gas 优化模式","id":"gas-优化模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Solidity 语言基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/solidity-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"智能合约安全审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/security-auditing"}}